<title>POLAND: Polish Ariel shoe firm to enter bourse on Oct 14.</title>
<headline>Polish Ariel shoe firm to enter bourse on Oct 14.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Stock Exchange on Thursday gave the go-ahead for shares in shoe firm Ariel SA to start trade on the bourse's parallel floor on October 14, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Ariel will list the one million shares sold in a public offering last quarter at 13.5 zlotys each.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
